{"server":"kr","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_04_end","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_04","title":"공범 증언","storyCode":"GT-4","avgTag":"작전 후","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/kr/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"6de5de59a78892e52f395b4954d9c382e71bd364d7b5cd697d8f6fd39cc7432d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第四关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"큭……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"저 녀석은 다리를 다쳤다! 먼저 해치워!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"그라니! 이대로라면 여기서 체력을 모두 소모하게 된다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"그렇게 말해도!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"클로어를 데리고 먼저 가! 빨리!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"다친 나와 함께면 신속하게 움직일 수 없어!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"나중에 어떻게든 나도 합류하겠다! 그러니까 빨리 가!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"알았어, 그럼 약속해. 당신 몫은 남겨둘 테니까 꼭 무사히 와야 해."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"……훗."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"가라!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"꼬마들이 도망친다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"빅 밥","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"너희의 상대는 나다!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"……싸우는 소리는 그친 것 같아."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"하지만 클로어, 좀 힘들어도 쉬고 있을 시간은 없어. 서둘러야 해."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"클로어","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"난 괜찮아…… 하지만 밥 씨가 어떻게 됐을지 걱정이 돼서……!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"아마, 아저씨한텐 시간이 좀 필요할 거야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"클로어","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"시간이 필요하다니……? 그게 무슨……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"클로어","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"앗!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"클로어! 괜찮아?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"클로어","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"미안, 나무뿌리에 발이 걸려서……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"자, 내 손 잡아."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"클로어","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"……고마워."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"걸을 수 있겠어?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"클로어","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"……괜찮아, 긁힌 상처니까. 그라니 말대로 빨리 가지 않으면……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"클로어","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"숲을 빠져나가면 모티카산 기슭이야. 거기에서 산 중턱에 있는 2번째 동굴로 들어가야 해."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"입구는 그 동굴뿐이야?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"클로어","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"응. 안은 갈림길투성이에다가, 숨겨진 길을 지나야 하지만 난 가는 법을 알아. 보물은 동굴의 가장 깊은 곳에 잠들어 있어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"응. 그거라면……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"클로어","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"꺄악! 무, 무서운 소리가…… 멀리서 뭔가가 폭발한 거야……?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"잘 들어보면 고함과 비명이 섞여 있어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"싸우는 소리야. 아직 끝나지 않았어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"……클로어, 무서워?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"클로어","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"난……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"클로어","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"……굉장히 무서워."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"클로어","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"하지만, 마을의 조용한 생활을 되찾고 우리 고향의 평화를 지키기 위해서라면…… 나도 할 일을 해야겠지."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"그, 그래……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"……클로어는 강하구나."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"클로어","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"응?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"그라니","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"후후, 아무것도 아니야. 자, 가자."},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["리유니온 멤버"]},{"speakerId":"char_220_grani","aliases":["그라니"]}]}
